  "goodToKnow": "Die Neutralität is neutrality: die Schweizer Neutralität, die Neutralität Österreichs (declared in 1955, a condition for the end of Allied occupation). In Germany, the state must maintain weltanschauliche Neutralität (neutrality on religion and worldviews), which shapes debates on headscarves for teachers and crosses in public buildings. Die Klimaneutralität is carbon neutrality, targeted by 2045. It has no plural."
